To Reproduce
Steps to reproduce the behavior:
libtorch c++ code:
  // load torchscript model
  torch::jit::script::Module module;
  module = torch::jit::load(argv[1]);
  module.to(at::kCUDA);

  // start evaluation
  long data[] = {4,   30, 1041, 1645, 244, 2};
  torch::Tensor sample = torch::from_blob(data, {1, 6}, torch::TensorOptions().dtype(torch::kLong));
  module.forward({sample.to(torch::kCUDA)});   // no error occurred
  module.forward({sample.to(torch::kCUDA)});   // crashed here



Expected behavior
No error occurs.
